    +--------------------------------------------------------------------+ ##
    |  With this door, you can either begin new games or sign up for     | ##
    | games that already have 1 player waiting. You can only be active   | ##
    | in a set number (controlled by the Sysop) at one time, 'though.    | ##
    | There is no restriction on how many turns per day, you can make,   | ##
    | but you have to wait for your opponent to have his/her turn before | ##
    | you can have YOUR next go.                                         | ##
    |                                                                    | ##
    |  At any time you can see the progress of other active games, or    | ##
    | the status of all the games. There can only be 99 games running at | ##
    | the same time.                                                     | ##
    |                                                                    | ## 
    |  Good luck in your games!              -Peter Deane                | ##
